cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SocialMemBench, please cite the paper below."
title: "SocialMemBench"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for memory systems in social group conversations: 43
  human-verified synthetic group networks (430 personas, 348 sessions) and
  1,031 QA pairs across nine question categories, with evaluation results
  for Mem0, LangMem, Graphiti, Cognee, and two research probes.
